# What the app needs to run, by name. `uv pip compile` turns this into requirements.txt, which pins each package and
# everything it installs to one version, with a hash for every file of that version (docs/maintaining.md, "Requirement
# hashes"). Dependabot opens a pull request when a newer version is out, and CI tests it before anyone merges.
